      "headline": "Trump signals unprecedented direct call with Lai Ching-te; Beijing protests, no concrete plans confirmed",
      "summary": "US President Trump said on May 20\u201321 that he would speak directly with Taiwan's President Lai Ching-te \u2014 the first such contact between US and Taiwanese presidents since Washington switched diplomatic recognition to Beijing in 1979. Lai welcomed the prospect, saying he would be 'happy' to talk and would stress Taiwan's commitment to the status quo and continued arms purchases. By May 22, four sources told Reuters no concrete plans existed. China's foreign ministry repeatedly warned Washington to 'handle the Taiwan issue with extreme caution.'",
