      "headline": "China deploys 100+ vessels in First Island Chain post-Trump-Xi summit; Pratas coast guard standoff resolved",
      "summary": "Taiwan's National Security Council Secretary-General Joseph Wu disclosed on May 23 that China had deployed over 100 navy, coast guard, and other vessels across waters from the Yellow Sea to the South China Sea in the days following Trump's Beijing summit with Xi. Separately, Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense issued daily reports of PLA aircraft crossing the median line and entering the ADIZ across May 19\u201324, including a J-16/F-16 encounter over the Taiwan Strait. A Chinese coast guard ship that had been in a tense standoff near Taiwan-controlled Pratas Islands withdrew on May 24 after more than a day of verbal confrontation.",
